        "action_date": "2025-03-06",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Hearing Device Coverage Clarification Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services to specify that fully implanted active middle ear hearing devices are prosthetics (not hearing aids) and are covered under Medicare.</p>",
